# Ballerina: Ballerina Language Specification (2024R1), lexical structure and keywords; requirements/languages/ballerina.md
name     ballerina bal

keyword  import public private function returns return if else foreach in while break continue match
keyword  check checkpanic panic trap type record object service resource remote isolated transactional
keyword  final var error worker fork wait lock transaction retry from where select let order by join on
keyword  equals limit is new client listener configurable enum const
type     int float decimal string boolean byte json xml anydata any never map table stream future typedesc
type     handle readonly
builtin  true false null

line-comment   //
string   " "  : escapes
string   ` `  : multiline interp=dollar-braces
escape        : u-braces
sigil    @    : meta
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
calls
